                    "contentType": "text",
                    "source": "Description:"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "header": "list",
            "subContent": [
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Client Company was one of the leading premium card subscription-based retailers. Every year customers will pay $120 for a yearly subscription."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 As the new year approaches they would like to understand how many customers will not renew their cards for next month"
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 We have built a model that predicts whether the customer will churn."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "header": "section_header",
            "subContent": [
                {
                    "contentType": "text",
                    "source": "Responsibilities:"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "header": "list",
            "subContent": [
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Responsible for  collecting  data  from  various sources such  as customer  demographics,  transactional data, and credit history. The data will be preprocessed to remove any inconsistencies and missing values."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Performed exploratory data analysis (EDA) to identify patterns and trends in the data. Visualizations such as histograms, scatterplots, and heat maps will be used to understand the relationships between variables."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Handle imbalanced datasets with the help of Smote technique. Responsible for designing test and train  data  sets  and  executing  supervised  machine  learning  algorithms  such  as  logistic  regression, decision trees, and random forests will be used to develop the classification  model. The model  will be trained using historical data and validated using a holdout set of data to ensure its accuracy"
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Analyzed the classification report, accuracy score, and ROC curve to gauge the performance of the models."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Identified the TPR and FPR for the models and communicated the KPIs to the stakeholders."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Conducted feature selection Feature selection techniques such as correlation analysis, feature importance, and stepwise regression will be used to identify the most important features that impact customer churn."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Increase the model accuracy by performing multicollinearity, and variance inflation factor analysis."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Used K folded technique to compare the accuracies across the models and pushed the results of the best models."
                }
            ]
        },
