                    "contentType": "text",
                    "source": "Description:"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "header": "list",
            "subContent": [
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 This project focuses on analyzing customer reviews in the retail industry to extract sentiment and gain insights into customer satisfaction. By applying natural language processing (NLP) techniques, the project aims to automatically classify customer reviews as positive, negative, or neutral. The sentiment analysis results will help retailers identify areas for improvement and enhance the overall customer experience."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "header": "section_header",
            "subContent": [
                {
                    "contentType": "text",
                    "source": "Roles and Responsibilities:"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "header": "list",
            "subContent": [
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Collect and preprocess customer review data, removing noise and irrelevant information."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Apply NLP techniques to tokenize, clean, and represent text data."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Train and fine-tune text classification models for sentiment analysis."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Evaluate model performance using appropriate metrics and iterate on the models to improve accuracy."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Generate insights and visualizations from the sentiment analysis results to guide business decisions and improve customer satisfaction"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
