                    "contentType": "text",
                    "source": "Description:"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "header": "text",
            "subContent": [
                {
                    "contentType": "text",
                    "source": "Spearheaded a project focused on real-time facial emotion detection using state of the art computer vision techniques, specifically YOLOv8 and YOLOs (You Only Look Once) models. Successfully developed a system that accurately detects and classifies facial emotions in images and video streams, contributing to applications in customer sentiment analysis and market research."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "header": "section_header",
            "subContent": [
                {
                    "contentType": "text",
                    "source": "Responsibilities:"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "header": "list",
            "subContent": [
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Researched and selected appropriate pre-trained YOLOv8 and YOLOs models for object detection."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Designed and implemented a custom dataset by collecting and annotating facial images depicting various emotions."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Pre processed the dataset, including image resizing, augmentation, and normalization, to improve model performance."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Fine-tuned the selected YOLO models using transfer learning on the emotion dataset."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Integrated OpenCV to capture real-time video streams from webcams and process frames for emotion detection."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Developed a user-friendly interface to display real-time video with emotion labels overlay."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Conducted extensive testing to evaluate the accuracy and robustness of the models across diverse scenarios."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Optimized model parameters and hyperparameters to achieve higher accuracy and faster processing speed."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Collaborated with UX/UI team to design intuitive visuals for the interface, enhancing user experience."
                },
                {
                    "contentType": "list_item",
                    "source": "\uf076 Documented the entire process, including data collection, model selection, training strategies, and technical details."
                }
            ]
        },
